<h1 class="page-header-title">General Jurisdiction Hearing Calendar</h1>
            <div class="page-header-lead">
                <div class="lead"><p><span>Look up hearing dates or other event dates by date, case number, case name, or agency name for the General Jurisdiction Division.</span>&nbsp;</p></div>

            </div>

    </div>







    <main class="main-primary">
        

        <div class="rich-text">
            <h2><span>How to Observe a Hearing</span></h2>
<p><span>Members of the public may observe General Jurisdiction Division virtual, telephonic, or in-person proceedings except where the proceeding is not open to the public pursuant to statute, regulation or order. Any observers may not participate in, record, or disrupt the proceedings.<strong> </strong>To obtain information on how to observe a particular proceeding, please contact the regional OAH office where the proceeding is scheduled. Contact information is available here: <a href="https://www.dgs.ca.gov/OAH/Case-Types/General-Jurisdiction/Contact">https://www.dgs.ca.gov/OAH/Case-Types/General-Jurisdiction/Contact</a></span></p>
<h2>Hearing Date Availability for Future Hearings:</h2>
<p>Notice: Hearing date availability calendars are provided as a courtesy to assist counsel and parties with conferring about future hearing dates. Dates are subject to availability at the time a Request to Set or other calendar request is processed by OAH. Dates shown as available are not guaranteed to be available. The calendars provided are not a reservation of hearing dates. These calendars are updated regularly.</p>
        </div>

        
        <div class="accordions">
<h2 class='accordion-title'>OAH GENERAL JURISDICTION OFFICE CALENDARS</h2>
            <div class="row">
                <div class="col-sm-12">
                    <a href="javascript:void(0)" class="toggle-accordion pull-right" style="margin-bottom:5px">Expand All</a>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="section-body">


                <div class="panel-group accordion" id="eb484a94-c900-4f2f-a008-5e9b3f89a2ac" >
                        <div id="IMPORTANT-DATES-AND-INFORMATION" class="panel panel-primary">
                                <div class="panel-heading" id="eb484a94-c900-4f2f-a008-5e9b3f89a2ac-824d3a92-8f1d-487f-a30d-5489bfe24847">
                                    <h3 class='panel-title'>
                                    <a class="link-IMPORTANT-DATES-AND-INFORMATION" role="button" data-toggle="collapse" data-parent="#eb484a94-c900-4f2f-a008-5e9b3f89a2ac" href="#accordion-824d3a92-8f1d-487f-a30d-5489bfe24847" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="accordion-824d3a92-8f1d-487f-a30d-5489bfe24847">IMPORTANT DATES AND INFORMATION</a>
                                    </h3>
                                </div>
