<div><strong>NO FRIDAY SETTINGS </strong></div>
<div>OAH at this time is not setting 1-day hearings on Fridays.  Setting consecutive hearing dates may include a Friday as necessary.  If you require a 1-day Friday hearing date, please contact your local OAH office to confirm availability.  </div>
<div> </div>
<p><strong>NOTICE</strong> </p>
<div>This calendar is provided to assist agencies and parties with conferring about hearing dates.  Dates are subject to availability at the time a Request to Set or other calendar request is processed by OAH. Dates shown as available are not guaranteed to be available.  This is not a reservation of dates.  </div>
<div> </div>
<p><strong>SPECIAL SETTING REQUIREMENTS</strong> </p>
<div>Parties with statutory time limits or other special needs for calendar preference should contact the OAH office to which the case is assigned.</div></div>
